Section 1 — Product States vs Entangled States
This is the conceptual foundation everything else builds on. The notebook constructs two two-qubit states and compares them.
The product state applies a Hadamard to qubit 0 only, leaving qubit 1 untouched. The result is ∣+⟩⊗∣0⟩|+\rangle \otimes |0\rangle
