The Bell state adds one gate: a CNOT after the Hadamard. The result is 12∣00⟩+12∣11⟩\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}|00\rangle + \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}|11\rangle
2​1​∣00⟩+2​1​∣11⟩. This can't be factored. There's no pair of single-qubit states you can tensor together to produce those specific amplitudes (only ∣00⟩|00\rangle
