Section 2 — The Bell State Circuit
The circuit is two gates total, which is part of what makes it so striking. The Hadamard puts qubit 0 into equal superposition: ∣0⟩→12(∣0⟩+∣1⟩)|0\rangle \rightarrow \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}(|0\rangle + |1\rangle)
